      "statement": "getUpdateNoopStatus refuses to skip an update when there is no previous update git head, when the previous run was interrupted, when the requested output language differs from the persisted wiki language, when the working tree has meaningful changes, or when committed changes since the last update touch source outside openwiki/ and outside the openWikiIgnore boundary.",
