      "id": "claim_b144c8584e7d466fabb111656b391c6d",
      "statement": "The required-page job inserted for stale or unresolved Claims instructs the worker to reconcile those Claims and update the page from current repository evidence while preserving unaffected accurate content, so a staleness marker triggers a source recheck rather than an automatic retraction.",
